  "Microsoft Entra Agent ID's interactive-agent flow has four steps: grant permissions via inheritable permissions or consent, authenticate the user and get an access token, validate the token and extract user claims, and acquire downstream tokens via the On-Behalf-Of (OBO) flow.": 1,
  "Microsoft warns that client secrets shouldn't be used as credentials for agent identity blueprints in production, recommending federated identity credentials (FIC) with managed identities or client certificates.": 1
